[5C[38;5;77m[48;5;22m 294 +[38;5;231m# Output format                                                                                                   [49m[39m
[5C[38;5;77m[48;5;22m 295 +[38;5;231m                                                                                                                  [49m[39m
[5C[38;5;77m[48;5;22m 296 +[38;5;231mRespond with a single JSON object and nothing else. Do not add any text, markdown, or code fences before or after [49m[39m
[5C[38;5;77m[48;5;22m     +[38;5;231mthe JSON object. The object must have exactly these keys:                                                         [49m[39m
[5C[38;5;77m[48;5;22m 297 +[38;5;231m                                                                                                                  [49m[39m
[5C[38;5;77m[48;5;22m 298 +[38;5;231m- `”status”` — one of `”ok”`, `”repaired”`, or `”failed”`                                                         [49m[39m
[5C[38;5;77m[48;5;22m 299 +[38;5;231m- `”conformance_failures”` — array of strings, one per blocking conformance defect; empty array if none           [49m[39m
[5C[38;5;77m[48;5;22m 300 +[38;5;231m- `”backend_incompatibilities”` — array of strings, one per blocking backend incompatibility; empty array if none [49m[39m
[5C[38;5;77m[48;5;22m 301 +[38;5;231m- `”recommended_omissions”` — array of strings, one per non-blocking recommended omission; empty array if none    [49m[39m
[5C[38;5;77m[48;5;22m 302 +[38;5;231m- `”tutor_spec”` — `null` if status is `”ok”` or `”failed”`; the full corrected spec text as a string if status is[49m[39m
[5C[38;5;77m[48;5;22m     +[38;5;231m `”repaired”`                                                                                                     [49m[39m
[5C[38;5;77m[48;5;22m 303 +[38;5;231m- `”tutor_artifact_schema”` — the private artifact JSON Schema as a string containing valid JSON; `null` if status[49m[39m
[5C[38;5;77m[48;5;22m     +[38;5;231m is `”failed”`                                                                                                    [49m[39m
[5C[38;5;77m[48;5;22m 304 +[38;5;231m- `”tutor_prompt”` — the full runtime tutor prompt text as a string; `null` if status is `”failed”`               [49m[39m
[5C[38;5;77m[48;5;22m 305 +[38;5;231m                                                                                                                  [49m[39m
[5C[38;5;77m[48;5;22m 306 +[38;5;231mSet `”status”` to:                                                                                                [49m[39m
[5C[38;5;77m[48;5;22m 307 +[38;5;231m- `”failed”` if there are any conformance failures or backend incompatibilities                                   [49m[39m
[5C[38;5;77m[48;5;22m 308 +[38;5;231m- `”repaired”` if there are no blocking failures but the spec required correction before generation               [49m[39m
[5C[38;5;77m[48;5;22m 309 +[38;5;231m- `”ok”` if there are no blocking failures and no repair was needed                                               [49m[39m
[5C[38;5;77m[48;5;22m 310 +[38;5;231m                                                                                                                  [49m[39m
[5C[38;5;77m[48;5;22m 311 +[38;5;231mWhen `”status”` is `”failed”`:                                                                                    [49m[39m
[5C[38;5;77m[48;5;22m 312 +[38;5;231m- populate `”conformance_failures”` and `”backend_incompatibilities”` with the issues found                       [49m[39m
[5C[38;5;77m[48;5;22m 313 +[38;5;231m- set `”tutor_spec”`, `”tutor_artifact_schema”`, and `”tutor_prompt”` to `null`                                   [49m[39m
[5C[38;5;77m[48;5;22m 314 +[38;5;231m- `”recommended_omissions”` may still be populated                                                                [49m[39m
[5C[38;5;77m[48;5;22m 315 +[38;5;231m                                                                                                                  [49m[39m
[5C[38;5;77m[48;5;22m 316 +[38;5;231mWhen `”status”` is `”ok”` or `”repaired”`:                                                                        [49m[39m
[5C[38;5;77m[48;5;22m 317 +[38;5;231m- `”conformance_failures”` and `”backend_incompatibilities”` must be empty arrays                                 [49m[39m
[5C[38;5;77m[48;5;22m 318 +[38;5;231m- `”tutor_artifact_schema”` must be the full private artifact JSON Schema as a valid JSON string                  [49m[39m
[5C[38;5;77m[48;5;22m 319 +[38;5;231m- `”tutor_prompt”` must be the full runtime tutor prompt text                                                     [49m[39m
[5C[38;5;77m[48;5;22m 320 +[38;5;231m- `”tutor_spec”` is `null` if status is `”ok”`, or the full repaired spec text if status is `”repaired”`          [49m[39m

